    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Available Immediately** **Fully Furnished** **SHORT TERM LET** Perched atop the prestigious Mount Prospect House in the heart of Clontarf, this exquisite 110 sqm three-bedroom penthouse offers a masterclass in coastal elegance and contemporary living. The expansive, light-filled interior flows effortlessly toward a private balcony, where residents can enjoy uninterrupted, panoramic views of the sparkling Dublin Bay and the lush greenery of St. Anne’s Park. Each of the three spacious bedrooms is designed with comfort in mind, while the open-plan living area serves as a sophisticated sanctuary for relaxation or entertaining against a backdrop of the sea. Combining the tranquility of a seaside retreat with the convenience of Clontarf’s vibrant village life, this rare property represents the pinnacle of luxury apartment living in one of Dublin’s most sought-after postcodes."
      },
